OL,5,G1900 Between the Ears: A Circular
OL,6,G     History of the Loop
OL,7,     FThe history of the unsung hero of
OL,8,     Fcontemporary music - the recorded
OL,9,     Floop - through interviews, unique
OL,10,     Flooping performances and
OL,11,     Frecordings from the 1940s to the
OL,12,     Fpresent day.
OL,13,G1930 Sunday Feature: New Generation
OL,14,G     Thinkers shorts
OL,15,     FDr Jacob Downs is a composer and
OL,16,     Fmusic researcher at Newcastle
OL,17,     FUniversity. He finds out how
OL,18,     Fwhispering is used in popular song
OL,19,     Fand why millions of people
OL,20,     Fdownload whisper videos.
